      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Per-turn pipeline",
      "items": [
        "Judge first: its verdict picks the actor's next task",
        "Actor streams sentence by sentence; one rule set for both paths",
        "Coach corrects the last message; nets catch what the model misses",
        "A correction must be retyped before the turn ends"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Local runtime",
      "items": [
        "One MLX model serves actor, coach, and judge",
