        "Per-role prompt caches keyed 'actor' / 'coach' / 'judge'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Content, state, and gates",
      "items": [
        "80 scenario JSON files load into Scenario/Task dataclasses",
